message: >-
  If you use Plexa in research or teaching, please cite this software using
  the metadata in this file.
title: Plexa
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Guinn-Bailey
    given-names: Kellan
abstract: >-
  Plexa is an open-source platform for instructor-authored, AI-supported
  lessons in higher education. It provides institutionally deployable student
  and instructor portals, a server-authoritative lesson runtime, and
  OpenAI-compatible inference integration.
repository-code: https://github.com/kjgb001/Plexa
url: https://kjgb001.github.io/Plexa/
license: MIT
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - higher education
  - learning technology
  - open-source software
